    "long_instructions": "#### Change how a section looks\r\n\r\n1. Pick one section of your page and name it.\r\n2. Ask the AI to change its colors, type, or layout.\r\n3. Try it out. If it's not what you wanted, tell the AI what to fix.\r\n4. Want to see the code? Switch to Split Mode.\r\n\r\n*Example: “Make the Events section dark blue with bigger white headings and the cards in one row.”*\r\n\r\n**Check your prompt:** Does it name the section and say what to change?",
